[View: WorkItemDetail]
route: /*/browse/*/
memory:
  - The work item key (e.g. ROCKET-1) is the last URL segment; the page shows it as a small button next to the title.
  - The title is a textarea with placeholder "Work item title"; edits autosave on blur, there is no Save button.
  - Right-hand Properties panel, top to bottom - State, Assignees, Priority, Start date, Due date, Parent, Labels. Each is an unlabeled button showing the current value; click opens its dropdown.
  - The description editor toolbar buttons are icon-only with no accessible names.

